  "summary": "<p>The attacks on President Donald J. Trump’s public service announcements are highly dishonest. The announcements are very clearly not campaign ads; President Trump is not on the ballot and there is no call to action. Instead, the announcements are a reminder for Americans to love their country and know why it’s worth defending — at [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/09/presidential-public-service-announcements-are-nothing-new/\">Presidential Public Service Announcements Are Nothing New</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
